CommandLine IN ("* client *", "* -socks5 *", "* -reverse *", "* -R:socks *", "* -tun *", "* -forward *") OR CommandLine IN ("*IcmpSendEcho*", "* -target *", "* -dns *", "* -port 53 *") Image IN ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe", "*\\rundll32.exe", "*\\svchost.exe", "*\\regsvr32.exe") NOT (Image IN ("*\\Windows\\System32\\OpenSSH\\*", "*\\Program Files\\OpenVPN\\*", "*\\FortiClient\\*") OR CommandLine IN ("*git-remote-https*", "*Azure*") OR username="NT AUTHORITY\\SYSTEM") | table Time,SourceImage,SourceUsername,CommandLine,ProcessId,ParentImage
